From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Brk Engine <brk-engine@localhost>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 13:20:52 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Support embedded tab resource management and store installs

Expose Chromium freeze votes and safe discards, keep the page wrapper across renderer replacement, and move existing tabs between browser windows. Release an idle shell protocol session before a discard while preserving user debugger protection.

Observe profile extension changes and skip the BrowserView post-install promo in embedded mode. Keep the native permission prompt and CRX verification.
